From 83e19e2515532b0c24f32c4389ff7ec66255b8ef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kas User <kas@example.com>
Date: Tue, 21 Jul 2026 11:30:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Makefile: build only rtw8922au, everything else is covered
 in-tree

Every other rtw89 chip variant (PCIe *e/*bt/*bte/*ce, and USB *bu/*au for
the 8851b/8852a/8852b/8852c families) is already handled by this tree's
in-tree kernel config (meta-beagleboard/recipes-kernel/linux/files/
makeitwork.cfg). RTL8922AU is the one chip still missing from mainline, so
trim this out-of-tree build down to just what it needs: core, the shared
8922a chip code, the 8922au USB variant, and the usb bus glue.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [OE-specific]
---
 Makefile | 81 --------------------------------------------------------
 1 file changed, 81 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Makefile b/Makefile
index 31f2c5f..a540784 100644
--- a/Makefile
+++ b/Makefile
@@ -25,94 +25,13 @@ rtw89_core_git-y += core.o \
 
 rtw89_core_git-$(CONFIG_PM) += wow.o
 
-obj-m += rtw89_8851b_git.o
-rtw89_8851b_git-objs := rtw8851b.o \
-			rtw8851b_table.o \
